<title>SRI LANKA: Vanik rises on growth expectations.</title>
<headline>Vanik rises on growth expectations.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vanik Inc Ltd was 2.9 percent, or 50 cents up at 18 rupees on 44,000 shares, as investors forecast good growth in the quarter to September 30, brokers said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors expect improved results for the three months to September 30, which are expected soon,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Vanik is an investment bank.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 5434319</p>
</text>
